egories that are based on ideas of personal responsibility and\u00a0assumptions about race are modified somewhat by a liberal commitment to human rights.\u00a0\u00a0 Our purpose in this course is to understand how such ideas have taken root and to locate the consequences of these ideas for policy and practice.\u00a0", "catalogBreadth": "", "catalogDistr": "(SBA-AS)", "catalogEnrollmentPriority": null, "catalogLang": "", "catalogForbiddenOverlaps": "", "catalogAttribute": "", "catalogWhenOffered": "Winter, Summer.", "catalogComments": "Distance learning.", "catalogPrereqCoreq": "", "catalogPrereq": null, "catalogCoreq": null, "catalogFee": "", "catalogSatisfiesReq": "", "catalogPermission": "", "catalogCourseSubfield": "", "catalogOutcomes": null, "acadCareer": "UG", "acadGroup": "AS", "lastTermsOffered": null, "exploreCriteriaIds": null}]}, "message": null, "meta": {"copyright": "Cornell University, Office of the University Registrar", "rosterDttm": "2020-06-25T19:14:22-0400", "catalogDttm": "2020-06-25T19:15:19-0400"}}